        "errors": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "u8",
      "kind": "CONCEPT",
      "label": "Formula relating moles and particle number",
      "excerpts": [
        {
          "text": "## খ) মোল থেকে কণার সংখ্যা নির্ণয়\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{N=n \\times N_A}\n\\]\n\nযেখানে,\n\n- \\(N\\) = কণার সংখ্যা\n- \\(n\\) = মোলের সংখ্যা\n- \\(N_A = 6.022 \\times 10^{23}\\)",
          "occurrence": 0
        }
      ],
      "attributes": {
        "depth": "statement"
      },
      "contextualization": {
        "value": "none",
        "evidence": []
      },
      "accuracy": {
        "verdict": "accurate",
        "reason": "The formula N = n * N_A is correctly stated.",
        "errors": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "u9",
      "kind": "EXAMPLE",
      "label": "Worked example calculating number of molecules from moles",
      "excerpts": [
        {
          "text": "### উদাহরণ:\n২ মোল অক্সিজেন অণুতে কতটি \\(O_2\\) অণু আছে?\n\n\\[\nN=2 \\times 6.022 \\times 10^{23}\n\\]\n\n\\[\n=1.2044 \\times 10^{24}\n\\]\n\n**উত্তর: \\(1.2044 \\times 10^{24}\\) টি অক্সিজেন অণু।**",
          "occurrence": 0
        }
